*============================================================
* SKY130 PLL CHARGE PUMP + 2nd-ORDER PASSIVE LOOP FILTER
* UP/DOWN controlled PMOS/NMOS switching paths
* Dummy devices for charge injection reduction
* ngspice netlist
*============================================================

*------------------------------------------------------------
* SKY130 model includes
* Adjust paths to match your local PDK install
*------------------------------------------------------------
.lib "/usr/share/pdk/sky130A/libs.tech/ngspice/sky130.lib.spice" tt
.include "/usr/share/pdk/sky130A/libs.ref/sky130_fd_pr/spice/sky130_fd_pr.spice"

*------------------------------------------------------------
* Global parameters
*------------------------------------------------------------
.param VDD    = 1.8
.param ICP    = 50u
.param R1     = 5k
.param C1     = 1p
.param C2     = 10p
.param CLOAD  = 6f
.param WNsw   = 2.0u
.param WPsw   = 4.0u
.param Lch    = 0.15u

*------------------------------------------------------------
* Supplies
*------------------------------------------------------------
VDD_SRC vdd 0 {VDD}
VSS_SRC vss 0 0

*------------------------------------------------------------
* Stimulus for CP control signals
* Use non-overlapping UP/DOWN pulses for test
*------------------------------------------------------------
VUP   up   0 PULSE(0 {VDD} 0n 100p 100p 20n 80n)
VDOWN down 0 PULSE(0 {VDD} 40n 100p 100p 20n 80n)

*------------------------------------------------------------
* Charge pump subcircuit
* Ports:
*   up down vctrl vdd vss
*
* Topology:
*   - PMOS sourcing path steered by UP
*   - NMOS sinking path steered by DOWN
*   - Dummy devices on each branch to mitigate charge injection
*   - Small switch devices only; current magnitude set by Iref biasing
*------------------------------------------------------------
.subckt cp_pfd up down vctrl vdd vss

* Bias current setting branch
IREF ibias vss {ICP}

* High-side PMOS current source and switches
MPSRC vdd ibias psw vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w={WPsw} l={Lch}
MPUP  vctrl up   psw vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w={WPsw} l={Lch}
MPUPD vctrl upd  psw vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w={WPsw} l={Lch}

* Low-side NMOS current sink and switches
MNSRC vsrc ibias nsw vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w={WNsw} l={Lch}
MNDN  vctrl down nsw vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w={WNsw} l={Lch}
MNDND vctrl downd nsw vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w={WNsw} l={Lch}

* Dummy gates for charge injection cancellation
* Dummy signals are complementary to active control edges
VUPB  upb   0 DC 0
VDNDB dndb   0 DC 0

XINV1 up  upb  vdd vss sky130_fd_sc_hd__inv_1
XINV2 down dndb vdd vss sky130_fd_sc_hd__inv_1

* Switch-controlled dummy devices tied to internal nodes
MDUM1 vctrl upb  psw vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w={WPsw} l={Lch}
MDUM2 vctrl dndb nsw vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w={WNsw} l={Lch}

* Output protection / local damping
RLEAK vctrl vss 100Meg

.ends cp_pfd

*------------------------------------------------------------
* Second-order passive loop filter
* Node naming:
*   vctrl = CP output / VCO control
*------------------------------------------------------------
RLF  vctrl vlf  {R1}
CLF1 vlf   vss  {C1}
CLF2 vctrl vss  {C2}

* Small output load for realism
COUT vctrl vss {CLOAD}

*------------------------------------------------------------
* DUT instantiation
*------------------------------------------------------------
XCP up down vctrl vdd vss cp_pfd

*------------------------------------------------------------
* Analyses
*------------------------------------------------------------
.option method=gear reltol=1e-4 abstol=1e-12 vntol=1e-6
.tran 10p 1u

.control
run
plot v(up) v(down) v(vctrl) v(vlf)
.endc

.end
